How can I create a C++ program that takes two numbers as input and prints them out in ascending order?You can achieve this by using the following C++ code:

```cpp
#include <iostream>
 
int main()
{
 int num1, num2;
 
 std::cout << "Enter two numbers: ";
 std::cin >> num1 >> num2;
 
     if (num1 < num2) {
         std::cout << num1 << "\t" << num2;
     } 
     else {
         std::cout << num2 << "\t" << num1;
     }
    return 0;
}
```

Explanation:
