a. Discuss the importance of visual communication in graphic design.
b. Show examples of effective visual communication.
c. Demonstrate how to create a visual hierarchy.
d. Distribute printed handouts on visual communication.
e. Ask students to create a visual hierarchy for a given design brief.

7. Individual Projects (60 minutes)
a. Assign a project in which students will incorporate the principles of graphic design.
