Provide the solution to the arithmetic expression obtained by adding the integer 14 to the integer 29. Your solution must be expressed in decimal notation and rounded to the nearest whole number. Additionally, you must provide a justification for your solution by demonstrating the use of the standard algorithm for addition, and also by providing a formal proof for the correctness of this algorithm. You must also provide a graphical representation of the solution in the form of a bar diagram. Finally, you must compare and contrast the use of the standard algorithm for addition with the use of alternative methods, such as the use of logarithmic tables or the use of a binary representation of the numbers.The arithmetic expression obtained by adding the integer 14 to the integer 29 is:
