- Students will learn various techniques for building resilience and coping skills, such as mindfulness, positive self-talk, and problem-solving strategies.
- Students will be able to apply these techniques to real-life scenarios and reflect on their effectiveness.
- Students will recognize the potential impact of stress and adversity on their mental and physical health.
- Students will understand the importance of seeking support when needed.

Materials:
