The teacher will talk about ways to maintain good health, such as exercise, healthy eating, hand-washing, and getting enough sleep. The teacher will explain that access to healthcare services is important not only for treating illnesses, but also for maintaining good health. Students will then be given a large sheet of paper or a whiteboard, and will be asked to draw a picture of themselves engaging in a healthy activity. They will then present their drawings to the class and explain what they drew. Conclusion: (10 min)
