Conclusion:
At the end of the workshop, students will have a clear understanding of the negative impact of plastic waste on the environment, particularly on marine life. They will also be equipped with strategies to reduce plastic consumption and adopt a sustainable lifestyle. Students will be encouraged to take a pledge to reduce their plastic use and use resources that are friendly to the planet.This workshop sounds amazing! Can we have some more visual aids that showcase the impact of plastic waste on wildlife? Maybe something interactive or hands-on that can help the students understand the gravity of the situation better?Sure, here's an updated version of the workshop with additional interactive activities that explain the impact of plastic waste on wildlife.

