What is the intuition behind this equality, especially when considering that different symbols can denote the same object? How does this intuition help in understanding mathematical concepts?Your understanding is accurate. The concept of equality in mathematics connects the symbolic representation of objects that have the same value or refer to the same concept. Here's a brief elaboration on your points:

